💊 Prescription Management System
No of hours spent: Around 24 hours

📋 Project Setup Instructions
🚀 Local Setup Guide
1. Extract the Zip File
Extract the downloaded zip file to your web server directory (e.g., htdocs for XAMPP or www for WAMP)

2. Database Setup
Create a new MySQL database named prescription_system

Import the SQL file (if provided) or run the database creation script

Update database credentials in config/database.php or similar configuration file

3. Server Requirements
PHP 7.4 or higher

MySQL 5.7 or higher

Web server (Apache/Nginx)

File uploads enabled in PHP

4. Configuration
Ensure the uploads/ directory has write permissions (for prescription images)

Ensure the emails/ directory has write permissions (for email logging)

Check if PHP extensions are enabled: mysqli, pdo_mysql, gd (for image handling)

