🐛 Troubleshooting
Common Issues:
Login not working: Check database connection in config file

Images not uploading: Verify uploads/ folder permissions (755 or 777)

Email logs not creating: Verify emails/ folder permissions (755 or 777)

Page errors: Ensure all PHP extensions are enabled

Database Connection Check:
Edit config/database.php with your local MySQL credentials:

php
$host = 'localhost';
$dbname = 'prescription_system';
$username = 'root';
$password = '';
Folder Permissions Setup:
bash
# On Linux/Mac systems
chmod 755 uploads/
chmod 755 emails/

# On Windows - ensure IIS/IUSR has write permissions
🔔 Notification System
Red dot indicator on pharmacy dashboard for new updates

Bell icon shows recent activities

Email notifications are logged to files in emails/ directory

Check the emails/ folder to view all sent notifications


📊 Checking Email Logs
To verify the email system is working:

Navigate to the emails/ directory

Open any .txt file to view the email content

New files are created for each email notification

Files are timestamped for easy tracking

🚀 Getting Started
Complete the setup steps above

Access http://localhost/Xiteb-Assignment/medical-prescription-system/login.php

Use the test credentials to login as patient or pharmacy

Test the prescription upload and quotation workflow

Check the emails/ directory to verify notification logging